# CS04 - FinTech Income & Expense Management for Irregular Earners MVP
# Environment Configuration Template

# 1. Supabase PostgreSQL Configuration
# (If omitted or empty, the application automatically uses local in-memory/file storage)
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-key
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=your-service-role-key

# 2. Google Gemini AI API Configuration
# Required for Natural Language Cash Transaction Extraction (Gemini 2.5 Flash)
# (If omitted, the app uses a built-in deterministic heuristic NLP fallback)
GEMINI_API_KEY=your-gemini-api-key
